{"sourceUrl":"http://www.philo.ecnu.edu.cn/b9/0b/c36259a768267/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:14.133260+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.philo.ecnu.edu.cn/b9/0b/c36259a768267/page.htm","html":"<div><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span>人工智能时代已至！算法偏见、数据隐私、自主武器、全球治理失衡……这些前沿挑战，正呼唤具备哲学思辨与全球视野的青年人才。习近平总书记强调“构建人工智能全球治理体系”。中法作为联合国安理会常任理事国，在人文与科技治理领域合作底蕴深厚。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>华东师范大学哲学拔尖学生培养基地（哲学系）</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span> 隆重推出</span></span></span><span><span><span><strong> “人工智能：新技术与人文”国际暑期学校</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>，诚邀您与法国里昂高校精英师生携手，在上海这座创新之都，开启</span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>天</span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>晚沉浸式哲学之旅！</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>一、活动基本信息</strong></span></span></span></p><ul><li><p><span><span><span><strong>主办单位</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>：华东师范大学哲学拔尖学生培养基地（哲学系）</span></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span><span><strong>协办单位</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>：里昂高等师范学院哲学系、里昂天主教大学哲学系</span></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span><span><strong>时间</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>27</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>日—</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span><span><strong>地点</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>：华东师范大学闵行校区（主会场）</span></span><span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>上海人工智能实验室、企业及外</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>  </span></span></span></span><span><span><span>滩</span></span><span><span><span><span>/</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>豫园等历史文化研学点</span></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span><span><strong>招生规模</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span><span><span>30</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人（中国学员</span></span><span><span><span><span>20</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人，法国学员</span></span><span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人，中法混编深度交流）</span></span></span></p></li></ul><p><span><span><span><strong>二、核心亮点</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>——</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>为什么选择我们？</strong></span></span></span></p><ul><li><p><span><span><span><strong>国际顶尖师资领航</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>：法国里昂天主教大学副教授</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>Mathieu Guillermin</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>（物理学与哲学双博士，</span></span><span><span><span><span>CONFLUENCE</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>研究单位成员，国际项目“神经科学与人工智能时代的新人文主义”（</span></span><span><span><span><span>NHNAI</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>）协调人）全程主讲</span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>“人工智能与新人文主义”系列四场讲座</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>；另有里昂高等师范学校、里昂第三大学、华东师大等中法学者线上线下同步联袂对谈。</span></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span><span><strong>五位一体沉浸培养</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>：专题讲座</span></span><span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>朋辈跨文明研讨</span></span><span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>特色“哲学行走”</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span> </span></span><span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>实地研学</span></span><span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>全球</span></span><span><span><span><span>AI</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>治理模拟竞赛</span></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span><span><strong>中法混编实战</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>个中法</span></span><span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>跨学科小组，围绕算法偏见、自主武器伦理、发展中国家</span></span><span><span><span><span>AI</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>公平等热点产出联合报告</span></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span><span><strong>哲学行走特色体验</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>：参观浦江实验室</span></span><span><span><span><span>/</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>上海</span></span><span><span><span><span>AI</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>企业，开展现场伦理评估；外滩</span></span><span><span><span><span>/</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>豫园人文行走，探讨技术与人文关系</span></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span><span><strong>实战闭幕高光</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>：中法青年团队“全球</span></span><span><span><span><span>AI</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>治理决策”模拟竞赛</span></span><span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>专家点评</span></span><span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>成果汇报</span></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span><span><strong>全程部分活动直播</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>，打造高规格国际青年学术平台！</span></span></span></p></li></ul><p><span><span><span><strong>三、招生对象与</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>报名方式</strong></span></span></span></span></p><ul><li><p><span><span><span><span><strong>中国学员</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>：全国哲学拔尖基地及合作高校优秀本科生（</span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>优先大二、大三</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>），对伦理学、人工智能、法学、国际关系、计算机科学等交叉领域感兴趣者优先。</span></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span><span><strong>法国学员</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>：通过中法合作高校联合推荐。</span></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span><span><span><strong>报名</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>方式</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></p></li></ul><p><span><span><span><span><strong>中国学员</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>：个人</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>在线申请</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>择优录取。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>报名材料</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）个人简历（格式不限，须有个人证件照，联系方式）</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2）成绩单（加盖学校教务处或院系公章）</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3）个人陈述（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>800-1500</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>字，阐述对</span></span><span><span><span><span>AI</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>伦理的思考</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4）身份证正反面扫描件</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>5）有关获奖证书和学术科研成果（若有）</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>请按照上述顺序将报名材料合并在一个</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>文档，以“</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>暑期学校</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span></span></span